      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7NmkyC",
      "title": "Add STRI (Strategy Income) token on Base",
      "author": "0gaAnozie",
      "number": 1295,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdding STRI (Strategy Income) to the Superchain token list.\n\n- **Name:** Strategy Income\n- **Symbol:** STRI\n- **Decimals:** 18\n- **Chain:** Base\n- **Contract:** `0x014b5195DF372AFF57D7182c2A0fd3b202F707c3`\n- **Website:** https://clawdstrategy.com\n- **Twitter:** [@ClawdStrategy](https://x.com/ClawdStrategy)\n- **nobridge:** true (Base-native token, not bridged)\n\nSTRI is a fixed-price ERC-20 token on Base that delivers weekly Bitcoin income to holders via AI-powered yield strategies. Each token costs 50 USDC with a hard cap of 500,000 tokens.\n\nThe contract is verified on BaseScan: https://basescan.org/token/0x014b5195DF372AFF57D7182c2A0fd3b202F707c3",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
